<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Xircom rated buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Xircom rated buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- First Albany said it added Xircom Inc to its Small Cap model, and rated the stock a &quot;Portfolio Buy.&quot;</p>
<p>-- estimated earnings of $0.35 per share for 1996, $0.88 for 1997, and $1.23 for 1998.</p>
<p>-- set target price of $24. Shares closed at 22-1/2 on Wednesday.</p>
</text>
